    "detailed_description": "<strong><i>Cosmic Dawn</i></strong> is a fast paced retro shooter that stays true to the golden formula of the genres classics while raising the bar with innovative monsters, weapons and a large variety of worlds to traverse. The game features four single player campaigns, of 10+ levels each, secret levels, mini-bosses and an epic campaign-concluding boss fight. The 18 different monsters can be engaged using over 22 weapons and their distinct synergies that lie waiting to be discovered and mastered. Cosmic Dawn also has a competitive horde mode where you can face off against waves of monsters which grow in power and size, the ruleset per match is highly customizable.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467250/extras/c6d90aefa3fc1d280bc20e2b614cf1e7.poster.avif?t=1712790555\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467250/extras/c6d90aefa3fc1d280bc20e2b614cf1e7.webm?t=1712790555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467250/extras/c6d90aefa3fc1d280bc20e2b614cf1e7.mp4?t=1712790555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467250/extras/49f4f6e020b3ccb0b5574a43559ac04f.poster.avif?t=1712790555\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467250/extras/49f4f6e020b3ccb0b5574a43559ac04f.webm?t=1712790555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467250/extras/49f4f6e020b3ccb0b5574a43559ac04f.mp4?t=1712790555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
